{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/807204-question-for-storytellers","id":807204,"title":"Question for Storytellers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-12T12:19:32-08:00","id":807204,"title":"Question for Storytellers","content":"I ran the first session of my Scion LARp last Saturday, and it was a blast. Now, I have to figure out how much XP is appropriate. We're doing a once-a-month game schedule, and I want my players to advance reasonably, maybe 1 legend, a few boons, etc. in the first 10 months (we're taking off November and December) of play... By year 5 or 6, they should be at Legend 9-10, gods themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7421-celtibear","name":"CeltiBear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T12:45:46-08:00","id":807219,"title":"","content":"Assuming you're there every month (a bit utopic, I know, but Math is a cruel mistress), Legend 9-10 would be obtainable with a whooping 9-11 EXP per session. That is, of course, assuming you're buying some other stuff on the side. A friend of mine ran the raw EXP needed to make a fully fledged God-Level character to adjust the Apotheosis mechanics-wise and I'm using his system of it as a raw estimate, which assumes that a new god has about 720 points worth of EXP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T12:49:10-08:00","id":807224,"title":"","content":"As I was thinking maybe 10-12, I'm glad I'm in the ballpark. Thanks, to you and your friend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7421-celtibear","name":"CeltiBear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T20:15:28-08:00","id":807547,"title":"","content":"Well the books pre-made characters say they've been given around 300 experience to spend in between each one, but that's to reflect the total passage of time between Hero, Demigod, God. Not sure how much would be appropriate for small increments, however.<br /> <br /> <br /> But yeah, I would say that maybe 5 or 6 experience a session would be reasonably appropriate. That would allow them to start raising at least one of their skills / attributes early on, but things would begin to slow down later in the game unless you increase the experience points at some point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T07:53:22-08:00","id":807877,"title":"","content":"I figure that if it's too slow, I can bump them up a Legend after an appropriately epic quest. Dealing with too fast is more difficult.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7421-celtibear","name":"CeltiBear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T10:46:30-08:00","id":808032,"title":"","content":"Hand out permanent Legend based upon the accomplishment of epic deeds.<br /> Remove the ability to buy it with XP entirely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T14:29:58-08:00","id":808234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/807204-question-for-storytellers?p=808032#post808032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hand out permanent Legend based upon the accomplishment of epic deeds.<br /> Remove the ability to buy it with XP entirely.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That would make sense from a story telling perspective. Instead of just <i>&quot;I think I'll become a Demigod now!&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T14:48:57-08:00","id":808250,"title":"","content":"You could always request a reason for investing EXP in Legend, though. Every LARP I've ever been in asks for why you put your EXP in what you're putting it in, anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T17:38:35-08:00","id":809253,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/807204-question-for-storytellers?p=808250#post808250\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could always request a reason for investing EXP in Legend, though. Every LARP I've ever been in asks for why you put your EXP in what you're putting it in, anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly. I don't think I've ever run or played in a White Wolf game were spending XP wasn't a negotiation between the ST and the player based on past actions, off screen time spent and future hopes. <br /> <br /> It also removes it from the realm of ST fiat, the perceptions of favoritism, etc. Ya know, all the things you have rules in a game for. If you take XP out of the Legend purchase, you need to give out substantially less XP as well, or you will have significant power bloat. Which is fine, if that's your thing, but it takes a pretty top-heavy and off-kilter system and throws a pretty big wrench into the middle of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}